-- kanditheemu
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Shaviyani Atoll, Northern Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,800 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.7 km long, 1.0 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"195 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Spectacular culture, amazing beaches, outstanding traditions"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, tradition seekers, nature lovers"}],"island_overview":["Kanditheemu Island is a spectacular local island in Shaviyani Atoll that offers visitors a remarkable glimpse into traditional Maldivian life in the northern region of the archipelago. This amazing island combines natural beauty with an outstanding atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking extraordinary cultural experiences and spectacular tropical surroundings.","Known for its amazing beaches, spectacular coral reefs, and outstanding marine biodiversity, Kanditheemu provides remarkable opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s remarkable community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their outstanding way of life with spectacular hospitality.","What makes Kanditheemu special is its spectacular natural environment and remarkable northern location. Visitors can enjoy amazing beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience outstanding island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the spectacular Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu Island is spectacularly located in the northern part of Shaviyani Atoll, approximately 195 kilometers from Male. This location provides a spectacular and remarkable experience in the northern Maldives, while maintaining outstanding accessibility through seaplane transfers or domestic flights.","The island''s position offers outstanding protection from strong currents while providing access to amazing coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Shaviyani Atoll in its most spectacular form."]},{"heading":"Kanditheemu: Spectacular Paradise & Marine Excellence","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring amazing white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most spectacular marine environments in Shaviyani Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in a remarkable, outstanding setting."]},{"heading":"Amazing White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu features spectacular white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and remarkable beach activities."]},{"heading":"Spectacular House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers remarkable snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Remarkable Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the outstanding spirit of traditional northern island life with friendly locals and spectacular Maldivian culture in a remarkable community setting."]},{"heading":"Outstanding Cultural Heritage","paragraphs":["Discover the island''s rich cultural practices and learn about traditional customs that make this community spectacular in the northern Maldives."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Kanditheemu feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and spectacular activities. The island''s remarkable environment and outstanding atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in an amazing, extraordinary setting."]},{"heading":"Spectacular House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the remarkable house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and outstanding underwater visibility in spectacular waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby amazing dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in spectacular marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, amazing sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Shaviyani Atoll with remarkable exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in spectacular community settings."]},{"heading":"Outstanding Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience spectacular Maldivian island life with remarkable cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy amazing sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in spectacular waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu is home to approximately 1,800 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and spectacular cultural traditions that create a remarkable atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Kanditheemu follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, culture, and community activities. The island maintains a spectacular atmosphere where visitors can experience remarkable Maldivian culture and customs in their most outstanding, extraordinary setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and cultural techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this spectacular island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Kanditheemu has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and spectacular cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Kanditheemu Island?","answer":"Regular inter-island ferry services are also available between Shaviyani Atoll islands."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Kanditheemu?","answer":"The best time to visit Kanditheemu is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more spectacular local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Kanditheemu?","answer":"Kanditheemu offers various accommodations including spectacular guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in a remarkable setting."},{"question":"What makes Kanditheemu''s culture special?","answer":"Kanditheemu is known for its spectacular and remarkable cultural environment in the northern Maldives. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering an outstanding atmosphere perfect for extraordinary exploration. Visitors can experience amazing cultural exchanges and participate in spectacular community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["foakaidhoo","feydhoo","feevah","bileffahi","noomaraa","narudhoo","milandhoo","maroshi","maaungoodhoo","lhaimagu","komandoo","goidhoo","funadhoo"]}'::jsonb
where node_type = 'location' and slug = 'kanditheemu';


-- kandoodhoo
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Thaa Atoll, Central Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,500 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.5 km long, 0.8 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"198 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Magnificent culture, pristine beaches, excellent snorkeling"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, snorkelers, authenticity seekers"}],"island_overview":["Kandhoo Island is a magnificent local island in Thaa Atoll that offers visitors an authentic glimpse into traditional Maldivian life. This exceptional island combines natural beauty with a pristine atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking genuine cultural experiences and magnificent tropical surroundings.","Known for its stunning beaches, magnificent coral reefs, and excellent marine biodiversity, Kandhoo provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s authentic community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their exceptional way of life with magnificent hospitality.","What makes Kandhoo special is its magnificent natural environment and authentic island setting. Visitors can enjoy pristine beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience genuine island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the magnificent Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Kandhoo Island is beautifully located in the central part of Thaa Atoll, approximately 198 kilometers from Male. This location provides a magnificent and authentic experience while maintaining good accessibility to the capital and international airport through various transfer options.","The island''s position offers excellent protection from strong currents while providing access to pristine coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Thaa Atoll in its most magnificent form."]},{"heading":"Kandhoo: Magnificent Paradise & Marine Excellence","paragraphs":["Kandhoo Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring pristine white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most magnificent marine environments in Thaa Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in an authentic, pristine setting."]},{"heading":"Pristine White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Kandhoo features magnificent white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and authentic beach activities."]},{"heading":"Magnificent House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers exceptional snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Authentic Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the genuine spirit of traditional island life with friendly locals and magnificent Maldivian culture in an authentic community setting."]},{"heading":"Pristine Sandbank Adventures","paragraphs":["Explore nearby uninhabited sandbanks and magnificent islands around Kandhoo for exceptional tropical paradise experiences with rich marine life."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Kandhoo''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Kandhoo feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Kandhoo offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and magnificent activities. The island''s authentic environment and pristine atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in a genuine, exceptional setting."]},{"heading":"Magnificent House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the pristine house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and excellent underwater visibility in magnificent waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby pristine dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in magnificent marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, pristine sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Thaa Atoll with authentic exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in magnificent community settings."]},{"heading":"Authentic Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience magnificent Maldivian island life with genuine cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy pristine sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in magnificent waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Kandhoo is home to approximately 1,500 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and magnificent cultural traditions that create an authentic atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Kandhoo follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, family, and community activities. The island maintains a magnificent atmosphere where visitors can experience authentic Maldivian culture and customs in their most genuine, pristine setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and fishing techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this magnificent island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Kandhoo has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and magnificent cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Kandhoo Island?","answer":"Regular ferry services are also available from Male and nearby islands in Thaa Atoll."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Kandhoo?","answer":"The best time to visit Kandhoo is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more magnificent local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Kandhoo?","answer":"Kandhoo offers various accommodations including magnificent guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in an authentic setting."},{"question":"What makes Kandhoo''s authenticity special?","answer":"Kandhoo is known for its magnificent and authentic natural environment. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering a pristine atmosphere perfect for genuine exploration. Visitors can experience exceptional cultural exchanges and participate in magnificent community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["guraidhoo","gaadhiffushi","dhiyamigili","burunee","vilufushi","veymandoo","vandhoo","thimarafushi","omadhoo","madifushi","kinbidhoo","hirilandhoo"]}'::jsonb
