update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Shaviyani Atoll, Northern Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,400 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.4 km long, 0.9 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"205 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Enchanting culture, beautiful beaches, superb traditions"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, tradition seekers, nature lovers"}],"island_overview":["Komandoo Island is an enchanting local island in Shaviyani Atoll that offers visitors a wonderful glimpse into traditional Maldivian life in the northern region of the archipelago. This beautiful island combines natural beauty with a superb atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking marvelous cultural experiences and enchanting tropical surroundings.","Known for its beautiful beaches, enchanting coral reefs, and superb marine biodiversity, Komandoo provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s wonderful community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their superb way of life with enchanting hospitality.","What makes Komandoo special is its enchanting natural environment and wonderful northern location. Visitors can enjoy beautiful beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience superb island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the enchanting Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Komandoo Island is enchantingly located in the northern part of Shaviyani Atoll, approximately 205 kilometers from Male. This location provides an enchanting and wonderful experience in the northern Maldives, while maintaining superb accessibility through seaplane transfers or domestic flights.","The island''s position offers superb protection from strong currents while providing access to beautiful coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Shaviyani Atoll in its most enchanting form."]},{"heading":"Komandoo: Enchanting Paradise & Marine Excellence","paragraphs":["Komandoo Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring beautiful white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most enchanting marine environments in Shaviyani Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in a wonderful, superb setting."]},{"heading":"Beautiful White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Komandoo features enchanting white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and wonderful beach activities."]},{"heading":"Enchanting House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers wonderful snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Wonderful Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the superb spirit of traditional northern island life with friendly locals and enchanting Maldivian culture in a wonderful community setting."]},{"heading":"Superb Cultural Heritage","paragraphs":["Discover the island''s rich cultural practices and learn about traditional customs that make this community enchanting in the northern Maldives."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Komandoo''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Komandoo feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Komandoo offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and enchanting activities. The island''s wonderful environment and superb atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in a beautiful, marvelous setting."]},{"heading":"Enchanting House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the wonderful house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and superb underwater visibility in enchanting waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby beautiful dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in enchanting marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, beautiful sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Shaviyani Atoll with wonderful exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in enchanting community settings."]},{"heading":"Superb Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience enchanting Maldivian island life with wonderful cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy beautiful sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in enchanting waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Komandoo is home to approximately 1,400 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and enchanting cultural traditions that create a wonderful atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Komandoo follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, culture, and community activities. The island maintains an enchanting atmosphere where visitors can experience wonderful Maldivian culture and customs in their most superb, marvelous setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and cultural techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this enchanting island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Komandoo has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and enchanting cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Komandoo Island?","answer":"Regular inter-island ferry services are also available between Shaviyani Atoll islands."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Komandoo?","answer":"The best time to visit Komandoo is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more enchanting local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Komandoo?","answer":"Komandoo offers various accommodations including enchanting guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in a wonderful setting."},{"question":"What makes Komandoo''s culture special?","answer":"Komandoo is known for its enchanting and wonderful cultural environment in the northern Maldives. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering a superb atmosphere perfect for marvelous exploration. Visitors can experience beautiful cultural exchanges and participate in enchanting community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["foakaidhoo","feydhoo","feevah","bileffahi","noomaraa","narudhoo","milandhoo","maroshi","maaungoodhoo","lhaimagu","kanditheemu","goidhoo","funadhoo"]}'::jsonb
